<title>USA: PS Group holders repeal staggered board.</title>
<headline>PS Group holders repeal staggered board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PS Group Holdings Inc said its stockholders approved the repeal of the company's classified board at Friday's annual meeting.</p>
<p>Accordingly, the entire board will be required to stand for re-election annually starting with the 1998 annual meeting.</p>
</text>
